Nit% J. j.ongland, Dr. Binns, Mr. Edward Wall ing,ton, Mr. ,T. Pidd n ck, Mr. S.W. Jeffery, and Mr. W. H. Payton. Numerous handsome floral tributes ' were placed over the grave, amongst those sending 'wreaths being the teachers of People's College, the infant school staff, her scholars in the third standard, her class at the evening school, Wycliffe Sunday School, Wycliffe Choir, her Sunday school class, and Wycliffe Young , People's .Society. l</p>
