        <p>The North Shields magistrate on Wednesday com- mittee a Frenchman named Kari to prison for one month for stealing a fire-grate from an unoccupied. house. This was the man's 26th appearance, and the court recommended the Secretary of State for the Home Department to make an order for his expulsion from the kingdom, on the ground of his being an undesirable alien.</p>
